mainmenu "ZBook UART one-direction sample"

config ZBOOK_UART_SAMPLE_ONE_DIRECTION_IS_TX
    bool "ZBook UART sample: one-direction"
    default y
    help
      This sample demonstrates the use of the ZBook UART protocol in a one-direction
      communication scenario. It configures the UART interface for transmission only,
      allowing data to be sent from the device to a connected receiver. The sample
      showcases the initialization, configuration, and data transmission capabilities
      of the ZBook UART protocol, providing a practical example for developers to
      understand and implement one-directional UART communication in their applications.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"